# Seedglaive Mentor's valiant counts only spells and abilities its controller controls (CR 603.2). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Rancor on
# Bot1's Mentor: it becomes the target of a spell Bot2 controls, so no counter is put on it (it gets Rancor's +2/+0 and trample
# only), and that targeting does not use up the "first time" either: on turn 3 Bot1's own equip ability targeting it is the first
# time of Bot1's, and the counter comes.

[Bot1 Deck]
Seedglaive Mentor
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Basilisk Collar
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Rancor
Forest x20

